          heading: Everything you need to know
          variant: variant-1
          cta_label: Ask a question
        type: faq
        lists:
          faqs:
            data:
              list_faq_1:
                answer: Yes — you can build and test everything on Siteglide without
                  paying anything. You only upgrade to a paid plan when ready to go
                  live with a custom domain. No credit card required to start.
                question: Is Siteglide really free to use?
                components: {}
                component_order: []
              list_faq_2:
                answer: The Free plan gives full access to every feature — Studio,
                  CMS, eCommerce, CRM, Secure Zones and Automations — in trial mode.
                  Build your site, test every feature and only upgrade when ready
                  to launch.
                question: What is included in the Free plan?
                components: {}
                component_order: []
              list_faq_3:
                answer: Unlike WordPress, Siteglide requires no plugins for core functionality.
                  Unlike Webflow, Siteglide includes a full CRM, eCommerce, memberships
                  and automations out of the box — on fully managed enterprise infrastructure.
                question: How is Siteglide different from WordPress or Webflow?
                components: {}
                component_order: []
              list_faq_4:
                answer: Absolutely. Siteglide exposes the full stack via CLI, API,
                  Liquid and GraphQL. Write custom modules, build fully bespoke layouts
                  and integrate with any third-party service.
                question: Can developers access the underlying code?
                components: {}
                component_order: []
              list_faq_5:
                answer: Siteglide handles all of it. The platform runs on Oracle Cloud
                  and Cloudflare, with DDoS protection, automated security patches,
                  global CDN and SLA-backed uptime — all included at no extra cost.
                question: Who manages hosting and security?
                components: {}
                component_order: []
              list_faq_6:
                answer: Yes. Siteglide offers dedicated infrastructure, custom SLAs,
                  single sign-on, audit logging and a dedicated account manager for
                  enterprise clients. Contact our team to discuss your requirements.
                question: Is Siteglide suitable for enterprise customers?
                components: {}
                component_order: []
